  transport_high-speed-rail_maglev-systems: Magnetic Levitation Systems
  transport_high-speed-rail_track-geometry: High-Speed Track Geometry
  transport_ice-powertrains_automatic-transmissions: Automatic Transmissions
  transport_ice-powertrains_drivetrain-architecture: Drivetrain Architecture
  transport_ice-powertrains_fuel-and-exhaust-systems: "Fuel & Exhaust Systems"
  transport_ice-powertrains: ICE Powertrains
  transport_ice-powertrains_manual-transmissions: Manual Transmissions
  transport_motor-vehicles_body-panel-stamping: "Body Panel Stamping & Welding"
